[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_02_0010","text":"……制作人，还在打电话吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_02_0020","text":"嗯……好像一时半会儿脱不开身……\n……等他的时候，要不要画个画什么的……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_02_0030","text":"那是小鸟吗？\n好可爱"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_02_0040","text":"……是３只！\n在一起开心地唱歌！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_02_0050","text":"呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_02_0060","text":"好嘞，那我也……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_02_0070","text":"……夜空的……舞台……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_02_0080","text":"那再给它们穿上服装……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_02_0090","text":"组合名，当然是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100300_02_0100","text":"illumination STARS──！／illumination STARS……／illumination STARS──！"}]
